  "description": "The RAMONES 20 is designed as a true mini-rider’s bike. It combines ease of use, light weight, efficiency, and a killer style!\n• The 7-speed SHIMANO Tourney drivetrain, combined with the Revoshift twist shifter, offers simple and intuitive control, and longer rides become child’s play.\n• A custom chain guide prevents derailments, and the cranks are adapted to small legs for efficient and comfortable pedalling.\n• The wide, knobby VEE TIRE CrownGem tyres provide grip, comfort, and safety on all types of terrain. Grass, dirt, gravel, it handles it all!\n• TEKTRO Aries disc brakes have levers designed for small hands and provide powerful and controlled braking. Your child can manage their speed with confidence, even when the terrain gets tricky.",
